sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cashier
    participant POS as POS Terminal
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant TXS as Tax Service
    participant DS as Discount Service
    participant CS as Coupon Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant RS as Receipt Service
    participant SS as Socket Server
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Cashier->>POS: Select order to bill / create walk-in
    POS->>AG: POST /api/v1/billing/preview
    AG->>OS: Fetch order details
    OS->>DB: Get order items
    
    par Tax Calculation
        OS->>TXS: Calculate Taxes
        TXS->>DB: Fetch branch jurisdiction tax rules
        TXS-->>OS: Tax breakdown (CGST, SGST, Service Charge)
    and Discount Application
        OS->>DS: Apply automatic/manual discounts
        DS->>DB: Fetch valid promotions (Happy Hour, item/order level)
        alt Manager Override
            DS->>AG: Require Auth
            AG-->>POS: Prompt Manager PIN
            POS->>AG: Submit PIN
            AG->>DS: Validated
        end
        DS-->>OS: Discount breakdown
    and Coupon Application
        OS->>CS: Validate Coupon
        CS->>DB: Check expiry, usage limit, min value
        CS-->>OS: Coupon discount value
    end

    OS->>OS: Calculate Subtotal, Taxes, Discounts, Rounding
    OS-->>AG: Bill Preview
    AG-->>POS: Display Bill Summary

    Cashier->>POS: Select Payment Method
    alt Single Payment
        POS->>AG: POST /api/v1/payments/process (Cash/Card/UPI/Wallet)
    else Split Payment
        POS->>AG: POST /api/v1/payments/split (Amount/Item/Equally)
    end

    AG->>PS: Process Transaction
    alt Cash Payment
        PS->>PS: Calculate Change
    else Card/UPI
        PS->>POS: Send amount to Payment Terminal
        POS->>PS: Await Terminal Confirmation
    end
    PS->>DB: Record Payment(s)
    PS-->>AG: Payment Successful
    AG-->>POS: Show Success

    par Post-Billing Operations
        POS->>AG: POST /api/v1/billing/finalize
        AG->>OS: Finalize Order
        OS->>DB: Update Status -> COMPLETED
        OS->>DB: Deduct Inventory (Recipes)
        OS->>DB: Award Loyalty Points
        OS->>Redis: Update Daily Sales Aggregates
        OS->>SS: Emit 'order-completed'
        
        AG->>RS: Generate Receipt
        RS->>RS: Generate PDF via Puppeteer / Thermal format
        RS-->>AG: Receipt Data/URL
        AG-->>POS: Print Command (auto-print / on-demand)
        opt Customer Registered
            RS->>RS: Email/SMS receipt to customer
        end
    end
    
    opt Refund Flow
        Cashier->>POS: Initiate Refund (Full/Partial by item)
        POS->>AG: POST /api/v1/refunds
        AG->>PS: Process Refund (Requires Manager Auth if > threshold)
        PS->>DB: Reverse Inventory, Reverse Loyalty Points
        PS->>RS: Generate Credit Note
        PS-->>POS: Refund Successful
    end
